# Inline formatting #inline-formatting

:::style
.status-pill {
  display: inline-block;
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 0.05em 0.55em;
  font-weight: 700;
  background: #e0f2fe;
  color: #075985;
}
.status-pill.success {
  background: #dcfce7;
  color: #166534;
}
:::style

Strong **text**, emphasis *text*, mark ==highlight==, subscript H~2~O, superscript x^2^, code `node.type`, math $$E=mc^2$$, reference @[inline-formatting], citation [@rfc-0001], footnote [^note-1], mention @{person:ada}, variable {{reviewer}}, and a styled span [[status text]].status-pill.success.

Spans can also carry direct safe style shorthands: [[priority]]{color="#991b1b" bg="#fee2e2" radius="6px" pad="2px 8px" weight="700"}.

